@startuml
 title Saga — falha de pagamento e compensação
 actor Cliente
 participant "Order Service" as Order
 participant "Saga Orchestrator" as Saga
 queue "Message Broker" as Broker
 participant "Inventory Service" as Inventory
 participant "Payment Service" as Payment
 participant "Gateway financeiro" as Gateway

 Cliente -> Order: Criar pedido
 Order -> Order: Persistir PENDING + Outbox
 Order -> Broker: OrderCreated
 Broker -> Saga: OrderCreated
 Saga -> Broker: ReserveStock(sagaId)
 Broker -> Inventory: ReserveStock
 Inventory -> Inventory: Reservar estoque
 Inventory -> Broker: StockReserved
 Broker -> Saga: StockReserved
 Saga -> Broker: ProcessPayment(idempotencyKey)
 Broker -> Payment: ProcessPayment
 Payment -> Gateway: Processar pagamento
 Gateway --> Payment: Recusa / falha definitiva
 Payment -> Broker: PaymentFailed
 Broker -> Saga: PaymentFailed
 Saga -> Saga: Estado COMPENSATING
 Saga -> Broker: ReleaseStock(sagaId)
 Broker -> Inventory: ReleaseStock
 Inventory -> Inventory: Liberar reserva (idempotente)
 Inventory -> Broker: StockReleased
 Broker -> Saga: StockReleased
 Saga -> Order: RejectOrder
 Order -> Order: Atualizar REJECTED + Outbox
 Order --> Saga: OrderRejected
 Saga -> Saga: Marcar Saga FAILED
 note over Saga,Inventory
 Se a compensação falhar, manter a Saga recuperável,
 repetir com limite e alertar para intervenção manual.
 end note
 @enduml
